# All-AI Demo game with Penalties ON and Line changes ON (OptPen / OptLine written before the
# game starts; the Demo default has line changes off), for the 4v4
# power-play checks (docs/FOUR_ON_FOUR_PLAN.md section 8): run with NHL94_FORMAT=4v4 and
# NHL94_FORMAT_TEST_PENALTY (test only) to force minors; AI on both sides can score on the PP.
WAIT 600
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS DOWN 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
WRITE_RAM16 0xFFD056 0x0001
WRITE_RAM16 0xFFD058 0x0000
PRESS START 5
WAIT 30000
